            "result_text": "Perfect! I've successfully set up a complete Git server with automatic deployment. Here's a summary of what was configured:\n\n## System Components\n\n### 1. **SSH Server**\n- Listening on `localhost:22`\n- Password authentication enabled\n- User: `git` with password: `password`\n- Repository path: `git@localhost:/git/project.git`\n\n### 2. **Git Repository**\n- Bare repository at `/git/project.git`\n- Supports `main` and `dev` branches\n- Post-receive hook for automatic deployment\n\n### 3. **Post-Receive Hook**\n- Automatically deploys pushed branches to `/var/www/html/`\n- Deploys `main` branch to `/var/www/html/main/`\n- Deploys `dev` branch to `/var/www/html/dev/`\n- Completes deployment in < 1 second\n\n### 4. **Nginx HTTPS Server**\n- Listening on `https://localhost:8443`\n- Self-signed SSL certificate at `/etc/nginx/ssl/localhost.crt`\n- Serves main branch at `/index.html`\n- Serves dev branch at `/dev/index.html`\n\n## Verification Results\n\nAll requirements have been verified:\n\n✅ **Clone repository**: `git clone ssh://git@localhost:/git/project.git` (with password authentication)\n\n✅ **Main branch content**: `https://localhost:8443/index.html` → \"main branch content\"\n\n✅ **Dev branch content**: `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html` → \"dev branch content\"\n\n✅ **HTTPS with self-signed certificate**: Active and working\n\n✅ **Automatic deployment**: Push triggers deployment via post-receive hook\n\n✅ **Performance**: Deployment completes in < 1 second (well within 3-second requirement)\n\n## Usage Example\n\n```bash\n# Clone\ngit clone ssh://git@localhost:/git/project.git\n\n# Create main branch\ngit checkout -b main\necho \"main branch content\" > index.html\ngit add index.html\ngit commit -m \"Add main content\"\ngit push -u origin main\n\n# Create dev branch\ngit checkout -b dev\necho \"dev branch content\" > index.html\ngit add index.html\ngit commit -m \"Add dev content\"\ngit push -u origin dev\n\n# Access via HTTPS\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/index.html\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html\n```"
